<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰλαιπωρ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard labour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.620
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				741
			</span></i>; also simply, <i>regular use, exercise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς χειρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hardship, distress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.117
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ τοῦ σώματος τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				2.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐν τοῖς ἔργοις τ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.17.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ τὸ πρᾶγμα τ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.53
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταλαιπωρίας ἐνδέκεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρυμένοι . . ταλαιπωρίῃσί τε
				καὶ ἡλίῳ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bodily suffering</i> or <i>pain</i>, caused by disease, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.49
			</span></i>.</div>
